                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Close to ready</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Retest in a few days</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Water darkens wood and disappears in minutes</td>
